SUMMARY:🦋 Traversing California: A Botanical Journey Lecture
LOCATION:East Bay Venue\, Contra Costa
DESCRIPTION:Join Ruth Bancroft Garden horticulturalist\, Michael Rada as he shares adventure stories and pictures of botanical finds from his (mostly) on foot circumnavigation of the mountains surrounding the Central Valley of California. Hiking\, biking\, and bushwhacking over 2\,000 miles through California&#8217\;s rugged Coast Ranges\, Cascades\, Sierra Nevada and more! \n\nAbout the Speaker\nBorn and raised in the https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/traversing-california/
